+                              (LICHII_UPSTREAM_GLOBAL_ROUTING=1, upstream #1681/#1757), with
+                              crash-trace.bat's pipeline-builds.txt. Only after a launch that got
+                              through the loading screen's build (a launch right after one that
+                              disappeared skips that build): if it gets through that build and
+                              plays, r65's crash was a stack overflow, which r66's 16 MiB stacks
+                              fix; if Lichii disappears again, AMD's driver can't build those
