+                              (r67); the next four are the same with one change:
+ title-no-early-context.bat   FSR made at the first area load (LICHII_FSR_EARLY_CONTEXT=0)
+ title-slim-off.bat           FSR 4's output in RGBA16F (LICHII_FSR_SLIM=0)
